* CapsuleTrack-EM patch coil driver - one channel, f = 14 kHz
* Phase-shifted full bridge (3-level output), series-resonant coil, current sense.
.param F=14000 VRAIL=3.3 PHI=31.05 L=0.000203123 RCOIL=13.2797 C=6.36246e-07
.param RON=0.28 RSENSE=0.5
VA a 0 PULSE(0 {VRAIL} 0 20n 20n {0.5/F-20n} {1/F})
VB b 0 PULSE(0 {VRAIL} {PHI/360/F} 20n 20n {0.5/F-20n} {1/F})
RONA a n1 {RON/2}
C1 n1 n2 {C}
L1 n2 n3 {L}
RCOIL n3 n4 {RCOIL}
VIM n4 n5 0
RSENSE n5 nb {RSENSE}
RONB nb b {RON/2}
.tran 0.05u 0.00428571 0.00285714 0.05u
.meas tran Ipk MAX i(VIM) FROM=0.00285714 TO=0.00428571
.meas tran Irms RMS i(VIM) FROM=0.00285714 TO=0.00428571
.four {F} i(VIM)
.end
